me":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-20T15:37:15","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"b34ff014-b534-4b8b-a4e6-bf58c30fe6a1","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190789608,"PostDateInt":1767950425000,"PostDate":"2026-01-09T17:20:25","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"产品营销经理（电梯）(J12358)","OrgId":700097322,"Org":"产品中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 产品与市场策略制定：分析市场趋势、竞争对手及用户需求，监测产品表现（销量、市场份额等），结合产品特点制定营销策略（如推广渠道、市场定位等）。\n2. 新产品上市：明确产品核心卖点，规划产品推广节奏和阶段性目标，负责制定新产品的营销计划并组织实施，组织制作产品销售工具包，作出新产品的销售预测并指导实施，对产品营销工作进行监控，协调解决产品营销方面的问题及产品交付工作，确定产品的定位及形象。\n3. 产品营销活动策划：主导新产品上市计划，策划营销活动（如新品发布会、促销活动、内容营销等），制作宣传资料（技术文档、案例、标杆业绩表等），并推动落地执行。\n4. 销售赋能：培训销售团队，提供产品话术、竞争分析及工具支持，助力客户转化。\n5. 拉通销售：消除信息断层、统一作战语言、构建协同闭环，确保产品价值高效转化为商业结果。","Require":"1. 全日制本科及以上学历，英语可作为沟通语言；\n2. 具备以下任一岗位 2 年以上经验：产品管理 / 售前支持、市场营销 / 品牌策划、销售运营 / 大客户管理；\n3. 熟悉海外 / 国内销售知识，了解海外 / 国内的市场业务流程；\n4. 能快速进行复杂产品学习，具备较强的用户洞察能力及产品卖点挖掘能力；\n5. 有良好的职业道德，有较强的责任心、沟通能力和解决问题能力，做事稳重踏实，工作细心。","ClassificationOne":"市场营销类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-09T17:20:25","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"69a3c66a-a1a8-4a9d-8d20-600c3f237234","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190785165,"PostDateInt":1766138779000,"PostDate":"2025-12-19T18:06:19","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"人资经理(J12325)","OrgId":700097329,"Org":"新能源动力事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["广东省·深圳市·光明区"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、主导公司人力资源管理体系的构建、完善与落地，涵盖招聘配置、薪酬绩效、培训发展、员工关系等全模块，确保体系贴合公司战略目标与业务发展需求，提升人力资源管理标准化水平。\n2、制定年度招聘计划与策略，拓展并维护多元化招聘渠道，统筹核心岗位及批量岗位的招聘实施，优化招聘流程、缩短招聘周期、提升招聘质量；搭建人才梯队，建立核心人才储备库，组织人才盘点与继任者计划制定。\n3、协助薪酬福利体系的优化与落地，确保薪酬的外部竞争力与内部公平性，完成薪酬核算、发放及成本管控；主导绩效考核体系的推行，组织各部门开展绩效目标制定、过程跟踪、评估反馈工作，联动薪酬、晋升等激励机制，激发员工积极性。\n4、统筹劳动合同签订、续签、解除 / 终止等全流程管理，规范用工行为，防范劳动风险；搭建员工沟通渠道，及时响应并解决员工诉求；组织员工关怀活动，提升员工归属感；妥善处理劳动争议与纠纷，维护公司与员工合法权益。\n5、参与公司组织架构优化、部门职责梳理，提升组织协同效率；主导企业文化建设，通过价值观宣导、文化活动落地等方式，营造积极向上的组织氛围，增强团队凝聚力。\n6、定期收集、分析人力资源关键数据（如人员流失率、招聘完成率、绩效达成率等），形成数据分析报告，为公司决策提供数据支撑；负责人力资源团队的日常管理、指导与培养，提升团队专业能力与工作效率。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，人力资源管理、工商管理、心理学等相关专业优先。\n2、5 年以上人力资源工作经验，有新能源、制造、科技等行业从业经验者优先。\n3、精通人力资源各模块理论与实操，具备较强的战略思维与业务洞察力，能将人力资源工作与公司业务发展相结合。\n4、拥有优秀的沟通协调、组织策划与问题解决能力，能有效对接各部门需求。\n5、具备良好的团队管理能力与领导力，能带领团队高效完成工作目标。\n6、具备高度的责任心、敬业精神与职业素养，严守人力资源工作保密原则。","ClassificationOne":"综合职能类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-12-19T18:06:19","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"d6908298-973f-4c51-98ea-505b3443cdab","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190782362,"PostDateInt":1764906089000,"PostDate":"2025-12-05T11:41:29","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"硬件工程师-伺服驱动器(J12295)","OrgId":2900666,"Org":"深圳市英威腾电气股份有限公司","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江苏省·苏州市"],"Salary":"15K-30K 元/月","Duty":"1、根据产品开发项目计划，完成硬件方面的开发任务，进行相关领域专利及知识产权设计。\n2、参与项目的技术评审、测试计划、测试方案评审，解决测试中发现的问题。\n3、根据研发流程的要求，在产品试生产阶段，配合中试工作，解决中试中发现的问题。\n4、根据技术战略及规划，开展本领域的新技术、新器件、新标准的研究，完成本领域的技术开发任务，完成技术预研、产品预研和跨领域的硬件开发任务。\n5、根据研发流程的要求，编写提供相关产品文档资料、产品数据。\n6、负责客诉品的技术分析以及技术改进方案的提出。\n7、解决产品营销方面的技术问题和产品交付方面的技术问题，实施产品维护。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，3年以上工作经验，计算机、电子、电气、自动化或机电工程相关专业。\n2、熟悉反激式开关电源设计，熟悉平面变压器设计，熟悉电磁兼容原理，具备良好的理论基础。\n3、熟悉常用功率器件（整流单元，电解电容，IGBT，MOSFET）的选型以及相关电路设计。\n4、做过高功率密度相关技术或产品，掌握SiC/GaN等宽禁带器件应用，了解一些先进的扇热方案，对功率器件热设计方面有丰富经验；\n5、熟练使用常用原理图设计软件（PADS，MENTOR）其中至少一种，有良好的文档设计能力。\n6、具有伺服、变频器、UPS、光伏等相关产品开发经验者优先。\n7、具备良好的团队合作精神，开阔的视野，高度认真负责的工作态度，能够承担较大工作压力。","ClassificationOne":"研发技术类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2025-12-05T11:41:29","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{